# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，检出时不做 CRLF 转换。
# 之前 core.autocrlf=true 会让每次 git add 刷出几十行 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 噪音，
# 而且 Windows/Linux 混跑时 diff 会假性全变。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源：不要做行尾归一化，也不要尝试 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.ttc binary
*.pyd binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary

# 生成/派生产物：折叠 diff，避免刷屏
reports/*.json linguist-generated=true
godot/tests/golden_resolve_hit.json linguist-generated=true
